tools/ollama-data/
**/*.gguf

# ===== 运行时数据 =====
tools/qdrant/storage/
.qdrant-initialized
*.log

# ===== Python 缓存 =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ===== 环境变量（含密钥） =====
